// Version:     0.3 (FormatFuzzer generation-optimized)
// Purpose:     WebAssembly (WASM) Template
// Category:    Internet
// File Mask:   *.wasm
// ID Bytes:    00 61 73 6D
//--------------------------------------
// History:
//   0.3    2026-06-17  FormatFuzzer generation-optimization pass.
//   0.2    2025-02-12  Delon: fix & update
//   0.1    2018-09-05  Harli: Initial version
//--------------------------------------
// FormatFuzzer modifications (derived from
// results_ai/wasm-orig/llm_reterived_constraints_wasm-orig_opus4.7.json):
//  - Pin _ModuleHeader.Magic to "\x00asm" and Version to 1
//  - Introduce single-byte constrained uleb128 typedefs (uleb128_*) that pin
//    val to the spec-defined value set for: section id, func-type form,
//    value/element type bytes, resizable-limits flags, global mutability,
//    import/export kinds, and data-segment flags
//  - Use these typedefs in _Section.Id, _FuncType.Form/ParamTypes/ReturnType,
//    _ResizableLimits.Flags, _TableType.ElementType, _GlobalType, _ImportEntry,
//    _ExportEntry, _DataSegment.Flags
//  - Bound list counts (ParamCount, ReturnCount, Count) and BodySize for the
//    fuzzer to keep generated modules small
//  - Append the 'end' opcode (0x0B) explicitly to _InitExpr and _FunctionBody
//--------------------------------------
// References:
//   WASM Parsing - https://github.com/athre0z/wasm
//   LEB128 - https://github.com/strazzere/010Editor-stuff/blob/master/Templates/DEXTemplate.bt
//--------------------------------------
// License: This file is released into the public domain. People may
// use it for any purpose, commercial or otherwise.
